The 10 markets in the YouTube arm's test group (the ones that bought extra YouTube) closed 3,741 deals from 2026-02-02 through 2026-05-18. The 10 control markets closed 4,403 deals over the same weeks.

I read "the markets in the YouTube arm" as the test group. If you meant all 20 markets in the arm, test and control together, the total is 8,144.

