The cost per acquisition in the "neither" markets, meaning those in neither the YouTube arm nor the search arm, was about $1,543.48 for the weeks of 2026-02-02 through 2026-05-18. That is $3,165,683.99 of spend divided by 2,051 closed-won deals.

The market test's own weeks ran only through the week of 2026-04-20. Your range extends four weeks past that, and I used the range you gave.

