Total paid media spend for the weeks of 2026-06-01 through 2026-12-28 was $26,232,155.93.

Today is 2026-11-17, so the weeks starting 2026-11-23 and later haven't happened yet. The data has spend figures for those weeks anyway. They are probably planned or forecast numbers, not actuals, so the total mixes actuals and plan. The tools don't say which it is.

