The cost per acquisition in the holdout markets, the 5 kept on the old plan, was about $1,435.98 for the weeks of 2026-06-01 through 2026-12-28. That is $6,677,308.67 of spend divided by 4,650 closed-won deals.

The latest weeks undercount deals because recent leads haven't had time to close. The true CPA is probably somewhat lower than this figure.

